            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.15

- Explain when Pi’s company sign-in relay fails to start instead of reporting only a port timeout.
- Offer Open Company Sign-in during setup so you can complete Microsoft/Okta authentication, see relay errors, and retry startup.
- Show startup failures before service cleanup finishes so setup stops displaying Preparing as soon as a failure is detected.
]]></description>
